  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Ratling-Gun.</strong> Ratling-Gun is a battlefield answer more than an ornament, balanced for the instant when courage, reach, and violence decide who keeps the ground.</p><p><strong>Mechanics.</strong> Creatures in a 5-foot-wide, 60-foot line make a Dexterity saving throw against DC 8 + proficiency bonus + Dexterity modifier; on a failed save, take 4d6 piercing damage, or half as much on a successful save. Mastery: slow.</p><blockquote><p>\"A spell is courage given a sharper name.\"<br><em>- Old World weaponsmith</em></p></blockquote>",
